{"id":"9f760cc852de5c08","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-zero-function.md","title":"Zero Function","display":"df-zero-function — Zero Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-zero-function","aliases":["90-df-zero-function"],"display":"df-zero-function — Zero Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-zero-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-zero-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zero-function — Zero Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(Z:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (一元零函数, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\nZ:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\; Z(x)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\nZ:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\; Z(x)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>: 零函数，将任意输入映射到 0</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是原始递归函数族的基础函数之一</li>\n<li>也记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}\">\\(\\mathbf{0}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a> — 投影函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a> — 后继函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"4d499aedd34b7bfd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-projection-function]] — 投影函数","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"b769360437f9e54a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-successor-function]] — 后继函数","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Z:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\nZ:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\; Z(x)=0.","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{0}","display":false}],"bytes":739,"backlinks":[{"id":"46caa19bb1e0ac82","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-zero-function]] — 零函数"},{"id":"88d284a5e496e4ef","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$Z : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}$ (零函数, see [[90-df-zero-function]])"},{"id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor"